    "longDescription": "“Data Monitor\" is a user-friendly, free and open source app for you to manage your data usage. “Data Monitor\" helps you to accurately measure your daily data traffic, and analyze the data in a way easy to understand. It also pops up warnings when you are reaching the data traffic limit, which protects you from data overuse. Please try “Data Monitor\" to manage your data usage and plan the best way to control your data traffic!",
